# Agent harness

1. Before any work, read and follow [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md).
2. Specs: [`main.md`](main.md) (contract), [`plan.md`](plan.md) (implementation),
   [`balancer.md`](balancer.md) (gateway practices). Do not paste them into rules.
3. Prefer small scoped diffs. No unrelated refactors or dependency churn.
4. Verify with commands from AGENTS.md; completion requires **observed** output.
5. Multi-step: update [`agent-progress.md`](agent-progress.md) (or
   `logs/agent-progress-<track>.md`) and keep [`feature_list.json`](feature_list.json)
   in sync when glue moves a feature.
6. Parallel agents: exclusive globs in [`docs/agents/OWNERSHIP.md`](docs/agents/OWNERSHIP.md);
   one git worktree per agent.
7. [`CLAUDE.md`](CLAUDE.md) is a shim only — not a second rulebook.
